│ patch_description        │ Tie rotation parameters by even/odd qubit parity, reducing the ansatz from 24 distinct    │
│                          │ circuit parameters to 6 while retaining more flexibility than fully global sharing. This  │
│                          │ symmetry-based regularization should improve few-sample generalization, parameter         │
│                          │ efficiency, and convergence while preserving the alternating structure needed to          │
│                          │ distinguish encoded features. Closing the CZ chain into a ring removes weakly connected   │
│                          │ boundary qubits and gives every qubit equal entangling degree, which may improve the      │
│                          │ worst-group margin.                                                                       │
