│ patch_name               │ staggered_shared_butterfly                                                                │
│ patch_description        │ Interleave the globally shared RY mixer with the first entangling stage instead of        │
│                          │ rotating every qubit upfront. Even qubits are mixed first, correlated with their odd      │
│                          │ partners, and only then are odd qubits mixed. This breaks excessive intermediate symmetry │
│                          │ and gives the multiscale CZ network richer data flow. The final RX layer reuses the same  │
│                          │ single parameter, retaining maximal parameter economy while converting phase correlations │
│                          │ into measurable populations.                                                              │
